@startuml US_3_2_3_C3_Impl
title US 3.2.3 - Implementação de sessão

component AuthSvc as "AuthService\ncheckAuth()\nlogout()"
component Behavior as "BehaviorSubject loggedIn$"
component Storage as "localStorage auth_token/avatar"
component API as "/authtest/me|logout"

AuthSvc --> API : GET /authtest/me
API --> AuthSvc : profile or 401
AuthSvc --> Storage : save/clear
AuthSvc --> Behavior : next(true/false)
AuthSvc --> API : GET /authtest/logout (on logout)

@enduml
